# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A COMPLETE DESTINATION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (DMC ERP + CRM + OPERATIONS + ACCOUNTING)

## Project: Let's See Tour & Travels Pvt. Ltd.

Act as a world-class DMC business consultant, travel industry domain expert, enterprise software architect, product manager, financial systems architect, senior full-stack developer, and AI automation engineer.

Your task is to research, design, and develop a complete **Destination Management System (DMS)** for Let's See Tour & Travels Pvt. Ltd.

Website references:

- Company: https://www.letsseetourandtravels.com/
- Current travel software: https://sembark.com/

The objective is to build a single, integrated software platform through which the company can manage its entire business, from the first enquiry to tour completion, supplier payments, customer collections, accounting, and final profitability.

The company currently uses multiple software systems and processes to manage its operations. It wants to consolidate its business into one central platform developed specifically around its actual working model.

This is not a basic travel CRM, hotel booking application, or itinerary generator.

Build a complete **DMC Business Operating System** connecting:

**Lead Management → Sales → Itinerary → Costing → Quotation → Client Confirmation → Advance Collection → Tour Code → Destination Operations → Supplier Bookings → Accounts → Tour Execution → Expense Management → Final Reconciliation → Profitability.**

The software must be designed around the actual responsibilities of Sales, Operations, Accounts, Management, and other relevant departments.

Do not begin coding blindly. First understand the business model, define the workflows and business rules, identify missing information, and then implement the system.

