# PART 34: NON-NEGOTIABLE DEVELOPMENT RULES

1. First inspect the existing project and its technical architecture.
2. Understand the business workflows before implementing database tables.
3. Do not build a generic travel CRM.
4. Do not treat the company as only a direct-to-consumer travel agency.
