7. Keep supplier cost separate from selling price.
8. Keep estimated cost separate from actual cost.
9. Keep customer collections separate from supplier payments.
10. Keep own fleet cost separate from external supplier payments.
11. Generate one unique Tour Code for each confirmed tour.
