18. Do not use mock data to pretend an API or integration is working.
19. Do not hardcode tax rules, payment percentages, or supplier terms.
20. Do not overwrite existing functionality unnecessarily.
21. Do not expose API keys or credentials.
22. Build proper error handling and background job monitoring.
23. Test business rules, not only the frontend.
24. Do not claim completion while important workflows remain non-functional.

