# FINAL PRODUCT VISION

Build a platform where every employee works from one connected business record.

Sales should never need to send incomplete information manually to Operations.

Operations should never need to ask Accounts repeatedly whether a supplier advance has been paid.

Accounts should never need to search through multiple Excel sheets to understand a tour's financial position.

Management should never need to collect separate reports from Sales, Operations, and Accounts to understand the actual profitability of a tour.

A single Tour Code should connect every department, every booking, every supplier, every payment, every expense, and every operational activity.

**The ultimate principle:**

"One Enquiry. One Booking. One Tour Code. One Connected Business."

Build the system as a scalable, secure, professional DMC ERP platform that can manage Let's See Tour & Travels' complete business from enquiry generation to final tour profitability.

Start by studying the actual business model, documenting assumptions and unanswered questions, designing the end-to-end workflow, and then implementing the system phase by phase.

Do not stop after building a dashboard or a visually impressive frontend. The complete business workflow, financial accuracy, operational coordination, and data integrity are the real product.